391a391e2b3f8d72bc5\" uuid=\"0050e8a2-9472-4b82-bc4c-e7a4c6b1a200\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"NDK_DanToc\">[[NDK_DanToc]]</span> <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_DanTocKhac]]\" uid=\"e8640f1c62acf7e0d0497460cd6b19b79\" uuid=\"0c1735f3-f416-4fe9-99ce-4994e95f1c1d\" type=\"x-select-area\" name=\"NDK_DanTocKhac\">[[NDK_DanTocKhac]]</span></p><p>(8) Số định danh cá nhân: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_SoDinhDanh]]\" uid=\"e4b5cb0fb06ce2275bebf4d33e2d5cac3\" uuid=\"16a98ffe-3956-4cbe-a649-74fb9c75704e\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"NDK_SoDinhDanh\">[[NDK_SoDinhDanh]]</span> Quốc tịch: <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-size:16px;\"><span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_QuocTich]]\" uid=\"e56f35bf7eadda13f5efbbe1ddb02a8f3\" uuid=\"687989b3-0e2b-4e0e-8ddd-c4efac620701\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"NDK_QuocTich\">[[NDK_QuocTich]]</span></span></p><p>(9) Giấy tờ tùy thân: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_LoaiGiayToTuyThan]]\" uid=\"ed76bac39c158a81130b5d7eb41d21e39\" uuid=\"c061d6c8-c1bb-4099-a5c7-fafb4a1a0be8\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"NDK_LoaiGiayToTuyThan\">[[NDK_LoaiGiayToTuyThan]]</span><span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_TenGiayTo]]\" uid=\"e5cf43f3518b8e156eba0974f00ce980c\" uuid=\"a987e3f1-a830-42e4-8cd0-9123f4047209\" type=\"x-select-area\" name=\"NDK_TenGiayTo\">[[NDK_TenGiayTo]]</span> Số: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_SoGiayToTuyThan]]\" uid=\"eaae84630f86502241127a826da0744d6\" uuid=\"5d610c9d-c569-4ed4-83c6-3ff537ceb78f\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"NDK_SoGiayToTuyThan\">[[NDK_SoGiayToTuyThan]]</span></p><p>Ngày, tháng, năm cấp: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_NgayCap]]\" uid=\"ef380c2343a21d84a502ba2931f9072eb\" uuid=\"7e653d58-5b40-4075-8f7d-36e657841430\" type=\"x-date\" name=\"NDK_NgayCap\">[[NDK_NgayCap]]</span>Cơ quan cấp: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_NoiCap]]\" uid=\"ee457a5fff1fc2004bea7991aafd01e8f\" uuid=\"44790cfc-4a4b-4649-b8b2-103269c408cb\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"NDK_NoiCap\">[[NDK_NoiCap]]</span></p><p>(10) Loại cư trú: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_LoaiCuTru]]\" uid=\"ef6337793d5b0857b90793bed04f1434a\" uuid=\"ebaac287-a695-43f9-ac0d-a3308866ee38\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"NDK_LoaiCuTru\">[[NDK_LoaiCuTru]]</span></p><p>(11) Nơi cư trú: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_NoiCuTru]]\" uid=\"edf5e0525191db75c7946dca60a54e6bf\" uuid=\"4dfed153-dd50-458b-9a82-daa6357cf8d8\" type=\"x-radio\" name=\"NDK_NoiCuTru\">[[NDK_NoiCuTru]]</span></p><p><span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_NoiCuTru_TrongNuoc]]\" uid=\"ece7c9b5c41ce9b9fd3822f9aae88661e\" uuid=\"c0effeb0-ef50-4835-b619-efe8d66cc9a1\" type=\"x-select-area\" name=\"NDK_NoiCuTru_TrongNuoc\">[[NDK_NoiCuTru_TrongNuoc]]</span> <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[NDK_NoiCuTru_NuocNgoai]]\" uid=\"ee4f3bed6948202103be5d2469f8eb060\" uuid=\"aecfa06a-8397-4e59-9246-bb59f234eb32\" type=\"x-select-area\" name=\"NDK_NoiCuTru_NuocNgoai\">[[NDK_NoiCuTru_NuocNgoai]]</span></p><p>(12) Loại việc yêu cầu cấp bản sao Giấy khai sinh/Trích lục hộ tịch:<span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[HoSo_LoaiYeuCau]]\" uid=\"e274577bea165f3144656b0a4abb47d7f\" uuid=\"db89b94d-8fb5-4262-a9c7-da7bff4d7886\" type=\"x-select\" name=\"HoSo_LoaiYeuCau\">[[HoSo_LoaiYeuCau]]</span></p><p><span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[LoaiChiTietBSCC]]\" uid=\"eeb3dd5b76c1e2c725ddec9dca1889470\" uuid=\"06d4f6ed-0272-40c7-aa3f-29cf87c113e7\" type=\"x-select-area\" name=\"LoaiChiTietBSCC\">[[LoaiChiTietBSCC]]</span></p><p>(13) Cơ quan đã đăng ký sự kiện hộ tịch trước đây: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[HoSo_CoQuanDangKy]]\" uid=\"e27f2a562aeee12bf81725c48fdd98ea1\" uuid=\"2c8e4773-2831-4ddd-a652-153896935acf\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"HoSo_CoQuanDangKy\">[[HoSo_CoQuanDangKy]]</span></p><p>(14) Tên giấy tờ hộ tịch:<span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[HoSo_TenGiayTo]]\" uid=\"e1c2ab99904ec3ef9eea8214e93b8af56\" uuid=\"b9897048-4235-4ea9-a8ba-e55d573e7c6b\" type=\"x-input\" name=\"HoSo_TenGiayTo\">[[HoSo_TenGiayTo]]</span>Số: <span class=\"mention\" id=\"[[HoSo_So]]\" uid=\"ef5e319846f4662e3ef6